{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "836fcbe31c43cdb0f9d3c4c8ebed94868d249470b9911a7731e86ca00c6c6ef9", "ja": "ブレストです！", "zh": "Brainstorming！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "67e20fa8d113d062f61669ff019b23cfc007ed7761ba18d1d50b2f0f20e5e7f3", "ja": "ロコプロデュースユニットのテーマはレトロ\nポップに決定した。昴や歩は思い思いに\nアイディアを出すが、桃子はいまいち掴み\n切れない。歩が説明をしようとするが、\n桃子はひとり外へ出て行ってしまう。", "zh": "ROCO企划的团体决定要走怀旧复古路线了。\n昴和步分别随意提出点子，然而桃子\n却不太能理解复古风。步想向她解释，\n但桃子仍一个人离席到外面去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5cb180d1d9aa3ea7a95ada8a6b4c1d705ad3d5bd0edfd021f5e520fbcfd2e118", "ja": "（ロコにプロデュースを任せた新ユニット。\nロコがスカウトしたメンバーは、昴、歩、桃子）", "zh": "（我把新团体交给ROCO来企划。\nROCO邀请来的成员有昴、步、桃子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "392d82fb1effb373e52d0096fb540a3292cf11aa94ec6b8bd158a41114fd307a", "ja": "（……いつの間にか、いいユニットに\nなっているような？）", "zh": "（……好像不知不觉间，\n组成了一个很棒的团体呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "e56f177fc94b207fbcf9b80303444f3a41a5d8feb914cb75c246f3941b8a9241", "ja": "なーなーロコ。\n他に誰か誘うの？", "zh": "欸～欸～ROCO。\n你还有邀其他人参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "92b82776ca87e5792ca261e96b5d4767c4301bb2d0f6f597dee4e6bef366a40b", "ja": "ザッツオールです！\nロコズプロデュースユニットは、この4人で完成です♪", "zh": "That's all！\nROCO企划的团体，有这四个成员就完整了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ff2c2ddf5f18220511ecd517c4fbabe1b764e379e50530d48977f67e7b58f89c", "ja": "そっかー。よし、それじゃみんな！\nあらためて、よろしくな！", "zh": "是喔～很好，那么各位！\n再次请你们多多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "174e0181d6fdba932010d140be3d89262da83d5ae7639bb281071c8c57d27d11", "ja": "へへっ、こっちこそ！\nみんなで、なんかすげーユニットにしようぜ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也要请你多多指教！\n大家一起组成感觉很厉害的团体吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "baaf9ec1a7a3de1b8bcf59920a5c0150eb6e338431dda79f47f9c0c388981599", "ja": "それはいいけど、\nどんなユニットにするの？", "zh": "那是个好目标没错啦，\n但我们是要组成什么风格的团体啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6a2f948d87169d1fdb55f5a56a58df37b84260077473d7ac22483442934d46e4", "ja": "そうだな、ユニットのコンセプトを決めないと。\nロコは、どんな感じにしたらいいと思う？", "zh": "是啊，我们必须决定出团体的主要概念。\nROCO你觉得什么样的感觉比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "85f9b0e5a10a63889dc2d3b5bd673a2bb66689f4cb068ed144fca4729aa26498", "ja": "そうですね。ポストモダンとか、グラムロック的な\nアプローチも考えていたんですけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛，ROCO本来是有考虑用Postmodern\n或Glam rock之类的方式来approach……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "82f6a34aedfa172da9887a40d8fc86a8a01b0ad0e71de6114b3d7fdab9c0dc91", "ja": "やっぱり、コレで行きますね♪\n今回のテーマは……レトロポップです！", "zh": "但果然还是选这个路线好了♪\n这次的主题……就是怀旧复古风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "430748cd8b67df28b95f6111cfb3b4e82d63d89c541181067312b1eba16b3376", "ja": "レトロポップ？", "zh": "怀旧复古风？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "430748cd8b67df28b95f6111cfb3b4e82d63d89c541181067312b1eba16b3376", "ja": "レトロポップ？", "zh": "怀旧复古风？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "430748cd8b67df28b95f6111cfb3b4e82d63d89c541181067312b1eba16b3376", "ja": "レトロポップ？", "zh": "怀旧复古风？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "3b3bfd993e325c7f186aa2a9038b33dfdfb16d74ba273e484c08e28dc4a5d73d", "ja": "まだ構想段階ですけど、手応えは感じてます。\nブレスト的にみんなのオピニオンを聞かせてください！", "zh": "虽然还在构想中，但ROCO觉得很可行。\n请大家说说各自的Opinion，来当作Brainstorm！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "025c69bc914f9b762792b451d674964d50a65f2ea7066ac12fc1d4687e053ad5", "ja": "レトロか～。よく聞くコトバなんだけど……\n歩、どういう意味だっけ？", "zh": "复古喔～虽然很常听到这个词没错啦……\n步，这是什么意思啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1fd1c7d7b3d1c5b29ea5fd737b10e585ed522e26e7d7c7c9c9eb6f02b14ac638", "ja": "え！？　そ、それはアレだよ、だから……\nちょっと昔……、みたいな？", "zh": "咦！？就、就是那个啦，就是……\n比较古早味的感觉……这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4594d3c722f76b5abddf2730e5e38f552b332d39f4eaabc57fdafd41f33227f1", "ja": "そんな感じかな。\n懐かしい、っていう意味だったと思う。", "zh": "差不多就是那种意境吧。\n我认为就是怀念过去的感觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "bee9a0934e4508a213f0101673b896be28f55cffe411e53d8d2cef2a2e10681b", "ja": "そっかー。つまり、懐かしいって思うくらいの\nちょっと昔、ってこと？", "zh": "是喔～也就是感觉很怀旧，\n比较古早味一点的风格，这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "d144f165afd5d34b9ee78c29ddae6064ffceeb51db7a63ed94c381dda3b79276", "ja": "イグザクトリーです。{$P$}のくれた\n駄菓子からインスピレーションしました♪", "zh": "Exactly，这是从{$P$}给的\n怀旧零嘴所产生出的Inspiration♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "80cba3f65495228be7d0f0bbaf94f4662ad2854834884fc16bedfae2cee58ca6", "ja": "あ、なるほど！　駄菓子って懐かしいもんな。\n小っちゃい頃を思い出すっていうかさー。", "zh": "啊，原来如此！毕竟零嘴很让人怀念嘛。\n会让人回想起小时候～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a42b9f586d8b00bd48212460b91bd8d4d7630af3d3bcfdb8f8d23352e036aa7", "ja": "レトロっていったら、アタシはディスコかな！", "zh": "说到复古风格，我会想到Disco！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c7c1409e398416e815476e76fb295a7d01d1aa125cecdda02e2d3238949d02b7", "ja": "アメリカには歴史の古いダンスホールなんかも、たくさ\nんあってさ。またああいうところで踊りたいなぁ。", "zh": "美国也有很多历史悠久的舞厅，\n我好想再去那种地方跳舞喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "51756c14ccd0c3364f22765123b1223c1d835ea220406d15e7a64f05f62cc19e", "ja": "あ、あと、うちにすっげー古い野球グッズがあるぜ！\n父さんが好きだった野球チームとかの。", "zh": "啊，还有啊，我家有很～古老的棒球周边喔！\n像是我爸爸以前喜欢的棒球队出的周边之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a22c4272b246fc34e5743701113b9a88b798f953a4f057192900027ce94fb32", "ja": "ああいうのがレトロって感じなのかな～。", "zh": "那种风格可能就是怀旧复古吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "2acb19c473927d9d2e108eebf3ea751520915d337de0b81cea44029f70e81153", "ja": "駄菓子……ディスコ……ベースボール……。\nデザインのアイディアは……ブツブツ……。", "zh": "零嘴……Disco……Baseball……\nDesign的Idea有……（自言自语）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1025_025roc", "source_sha256": "e2c85eb635264ac5677c5e6aa5cf9832b6990aa39fd3a03d07c142a77fb1b0a8", "ja": "モモコは、どういうイメージですか？\nフラッシュアイディアでいいので、聞かせてください！", "zh": "桃子你对复古有什么印象呢？\n就算只是Flash Idea也好，都说说看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "b7cc8dea586be2f2ee8136e43cd586713021b8a9b713a21b1031d57f63858a38", "ja": "桃子は……よくわかんない。\n懐かしいとか、あんまり思ったことない。", "zh": "桃子……不太清楚。\n桃子很少对什么感到怀念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "183a0228263477eb15becb5cb596b5019e32b31f20c8a0c7347dcfc43eb207f4", "ja": "（……そうか。まだ子どもの桃子が、\nレトロって言われても……）", "zh": "（……也是，桃子还是小孩子，\n就算问她什么是复古风也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "0fe76af90dc6773c74863465bf56174f97fb9fc7f982d49633435dff7fed9436", "ja": "駄菓子だって、ただの新しいお菓子だって\n思うだけだよ。", "zh": "就算看到怀旧零嘴，\n桃子也只会觉得是新款的零食而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "32720c3fdcb1184007ea1302149171c8f3ab11122c5a6b81f6728b457cf9993c", "ja": "あ……。そ、そうだよな。いくら桃子がしっかり\nしてても、昔を懐かしむ年じゃないもんな。", "zh": "啊……也、也是啦。就算桃子很能干，\n但年纪也还没大到会怀念过去嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d2289688755783b14c80f4de584beb612496a2d3f2932c09ca4e36e1f1dae9d4", "ja": "う～ん、どう説明すればいいか……。\nなんかこう、セピア色の写真、みたいな？", "zh": "嗯～该怎么说明才好呢……\n就是像泛黄的黑白照片那样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "413df771e0ab3ac99801996d0557967c127ee0cc9cd67574eeef3d2204fdee9f", "ja": "べつに説明しなくていいよ。\n昴さんと歩さんにはわかってるみたいだし。", "zh": "不用特别说明啦。\n反正昴姊和步姊你们好像已经懂那是什么意思了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "b00a39d0e3b5e2a550b9d8b2b2d6eb38c4c9a867086fc02d2bc6460d4bc9d5a3", "ja": "コンセプトも、ロコさんと歩さんたちで\n決めてくれれば、それでいいから。", "zh": "主题也交给ROCO姊和步姊\n你们来决定就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "337baf396c1ec043f3e86ee23a61115ee038b0f5f4f3512b2304d1dcf0cd8bfe", "ja": "いやいやいや。\nそういうのは、ちょっとさぁ。", "zh": "不行不行不行。\n那样不好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "0f555cb5e89e311a7815170fcf812697f05bbf164993c92564c5b70030d39d63", "ja": "あ、それじゃ、桃子の好きな物も入れようぜ！\nステージでホットケーキ食べるとか！", "zh": "啊，那也加入一些桃子喜欢的东西吧！\n像是在舞台上吃松饼之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a97af7f24b69bca6953f616a28eabfb723bd6eeed33e918e24a9d1e46910fe93", "ja": "おおっ、いいじゃん！\nなんか新しいね、それ！", "zh": "哦哦，不错耶！\n这点子听起来很创新！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "67f8db86c4d4553079f1d19dff365dae4a4e7bae5a8590c24fc567dd94e6e609", "ja": "……新しかったらダメなんじゃないの？\nレトロって、ちょっと古いんでしょ。", "zh": "……不能够太创新吧？\n复古风格不是要比较旧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5761dea904449c2f97c5a35572c1b4a2fae8c317722834420f9fe04258e2aa51", "ja": "あ。それもそっか……。いやでも、ホットケーキも\nちょっと懐かしいからセーフ～！　じゃないかな？", "zh": "啊，那倒也是……不过松饼也有点让人怀念，\n也能算在复古范围内吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "af3138636104b5bc8607ad0ab96af6a2513ad46146f799f43ce625e626023c0f", "ja": "もう、ムリに桃子に合わせなくていいよ。\nコンセプトは、みんなで決めて。", "zh": "真是的，不用勉强配合桃子啦，\n主题就交给你们大家来决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "fdad4480ec4226330a64796363c54fd441bb4b74bb9e74e9e7903806ce8610c8", "ja": "桃子は、ちょっと外に出てくる。", "zh": "桃子出去外面一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d2399dd971c2283f3b56ab7552bb09a6fc7a0a866ae4e175cbff0a6173add4d8", "ja": "わっ、桃子！　行っちゃうの！？", "zh": "哇，桃子！你要走了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "e85fab3b1b45de179c3929c89c0c48e1201be898bb69484459c597e33dd2d62d", "ja": "も、桃子～。", "zh": "桃、桃子～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1042_025roc", "source_sha256": "55444f168101e9d6947b6dae49129a542da3c585d4c065369748abe2ae3209ce", "ja": "……オールディーズミュージックを取り入れるなら……\nワールドトレンド的に考えると……ブツブツ……。", "zh": "……既然要融入Oldies music……\n就World trend层面来思考的话……（自言自语）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "af873d3a4bf376c9dfecd0bd03b434a200a14a9c5ac86b4f3036c5209bd86e35", "ja": "よし、俺はちょっと桃子を見てくるよ。\nみんなはここにいてくれ。", "zh": "好，我去看一下桃子。\n你们先待在这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "73aa4b1cfa036415aa658a1bc8aec9c50641265be80bf2a38109a29e65804aef", "ja": "桃子、ちょっと待ってくれ。\nもう少しみんなの話を聞いてみないか？", "zh": "桃子，等等我。\n你要不要再听一下大家怎么说啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "535cdb8b7b32b9e66bb31ba9569e6939bc6eb7ccb9e7eb7e87ec4332b226b6a3", "ja": "お兄ちゃん……。追いかけてこなくていいよ。\nユニットのこと決めるんでしょ？", "zh": "大哥哥……你不用追出来啦。\n不是要讨论团体的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "af172db08c2caed1bd72ec032508205749ce1e40d2bf99dc2d051124a4afb871", "ja": "桃子、べつに怒って出てきたんじゃないよ。ただ\n桃子がいると、みんな気を使っちゃうみたいだから。", "zh": "桃子不是因为生气才跑出来的。\n只是担心桃子待在那边会让其他人有所顾虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1047_p", "source_sha256": "650a961173ff60ca1f436ea01a26b680e9ccc793156173ae4b7e87ca4e24a07a", "ja": "けど……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1048_049mom", "source_sha256": "a674a5670567b3268eeee2e27263d1fe2b5f1338c4098251347327e6aa1c6237", "ja": "いいから、お兄ちゃんはみんなと話し合いしてて！\n桃子は心配ないから、ついてこないで！", "zh": "好了啦，大哥哥你去和大家讨论吧！\n不需要担心桃子的，不要跟过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "595f11bad758c23135c13413659503de6c30bc6049511790145c1d0172429142", "ja": "絶対についてこないでね！\nいい？　わかった？　それじゃあね！", "zh": "绝对别跟过来喔！\n听见了吗？懂了吗？那就这样了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7b09e481d03d48c8370384e47a228e9376ecc63a34fc6271bfdc4ebc70bc8002", "ja": "（桃子は行ってしまった。\nたしかに、落ち込んでる様子じゃなかったな……？）", "zh": "（桃子走掉了。\n她确实看起来没有很沮丧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
